ry-week","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado and Mark Zinno","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T03:40:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football betting: Should you still bet on Indiana to make the CFP?","description":"The Hoosiers dropped to No. 14 in the latest CPF rankings, but are they still a good bet to make the playoff?","published":"2026-11-25T04:16:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50588403/2026-college-football-playoff-cfp-indiana-hoosiers","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 Anger Index: Indiana dropped how many spots?!","description":"Ranking the teams that should be most upset with the latest CFP rankings.","published":"2026-11-25T14:21:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50582371/cfp-ranking-2026-anger-index-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the College Football Playoff bubble after committee's fourth ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-25T14:12:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Why UTEP-NIU is 2026's most unglamorous Game of the Century","description":"The Week 13 game will mark the first time since at least 2000 that two teams that are winless against FBS opponents will meet in their final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T01:19:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50587546/utep-niu-college-football-game-century","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Indiana falls from 12-team field in 4th CFP rankings; Horns, Vols leap Bama","description":"Defending champ Indiana fell six spots to No. 14, while Alabama was leaped by Texas and Tennessee and fell out of the top five in the latest CFP rankings Tuesday night.","published":"2026-11-25T07:42:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588082/indiana-top-12-cfp-rankings-texas-tennessee-leap-alabama","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138451/luke-reynolds","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":43,"round":2,"team":"LV","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Luke Reynolds (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:17:37Z","intro":"Luke Reynolds is an American college football tight end for the Virginia Tech Hokies. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Reynolds grew up in Westford, Massachusetts and originally attended Lawrence Academy in Groton, Massachusetts. He transferred to Cheshire Academy in Cheshire, Connecticut after his sophomore year. As a senior, he caught 48 passes for 754 yards and nine touchdowns. After the season Reynolds played in the 2024 All-American Bowl.\nReynolds was initially rated a three-star recruit and committed to play college football at Penn State. He was later reranked as a five-star recruit and the best tight end prospect in the 2024 class by 247Sports."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Reynolds joined the Penn State Nittany Lions as an early enrollee in January 2024. He entered his freshman season as a backup at tight end to Tyler Warren. Reynolds finished his first season with the team with nine receptions for 111 yards and one touchdown. He played in all 13 of the Nittany Lions' games as a sophomore and caught 26 passes for 257 yards. After the end of the season, Reynolds entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nReynolds transferred to Virginia Tech, reuniting him with former Penn State head coach James Franklin."}]}}